{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/attah_vechartanu_mikol"}}
{"text":"Thou hast chosen us from all peoples, loved us and found delight in us and exalted us above all tongues and sanctified us through Thy commandments, and brought us near, O our King, to Thy service and proclaimed Thy great and holy Name unto us."}
